{"seq":1,"slug":"two-man-inside-delivery","title":"两人入户派送（two-man）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bulky-goods-whiteglove-delivery/two-man-delivery-scheduling/two-man-inside-delivery","wordCount":1828,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"两人入户派送-two-man\">两人入户派送（two-man）</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>「两人派送」不是「一个人搬不动就再叫一个人」，而是一个由<strong>人力提升极限</strong>推导出来的作业编制。它有三层含义：人数（两人同行）、装备（车上有搬运带、护角、垫布、可能的爬楼机）、以及作业节奏（两人协同抬升有固定的口令与站位，不能各抬各的）。</p>\n<p>把这层编制变成系统设计，需要先回答一个纯物理问题：<strong>两个人合起来能安全抬多重？</strong> 这个问题有公开的量化方法，不该靠经验猜。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  Order[大件派送单] --&gt; W[单件重量与外形]&#10;  W --&gt; Judge{提升限值判定}&#10;  Judge --&gt;|单件 &lt;= 单人安全限值| One[单人可搬运但仍需双人同行&lt;br/&gt;协同/搬运道具体积件]&#10;  Judge --&gt;|单人限值 &lt; 单件 &lt;= 双人限值| Two[两人协同抬升]&#10;  Judge --&gt;|超过双人限值| Mech[必须机械吊装或拆件搬运]&#10;  Two --&gt; Van[双人班组 + 搬运带 + 护角]&#10;  Mech --&gt; Plan[预约时说明需吊装/拆包/走阳台]\">graph TD\n  Order[大件派送单] --&gt; W[单件重量与外形]\n  W --&gt; Judge{提升限值判定}\n  Judge --&gt;|单件 &lt;= 单人安全限值| One[单人可搬运但仍需双人同行&lt;br/&gt;协同/搬运道具体积件]\n  Judge --&gt;|单人限值 &lt; 单件 &lt;= 双人限值| Two[两人协同抬升]\n  Judge --&gt;|超过双人限值| Mech[必须机械吊装或拆件搬运]\n  Two --&gt; Van[双人班组 + 搬运带 + 护角]\n  Mech --&gt; Plan[预约时说明需吊装/拆包/走阳台]</pre><h2 id=\"提升限值的量化\">提升限值的量化</h2><h3 id=\"niosh-提升方程\">NIOSH 提升方程</h3><p>职业健康领域对「多少重量算安全」有一个被广泛引用的模型：美国 NIOSH 的修订版提升方程（Revised NIOSH Lifting Equation, RNLE）。它把一次提升任务的推荐重量上限写成一个基准常数乘以六个修正因子：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>W</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>H</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>V</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RWL = LC \\times HM \\times VM \\times DM \\times AM \\times FM \\times CM</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中负载常数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>51</mn><mtext> lb</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>23</mn><mtext> kg</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LC = 51\\ \\text{lb} = 23\\ \\text{kg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">51</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">lb</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">23</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kg</span></span></span></span></span></span>，各因子分别修正水平距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">HM = 25/H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span>（H 以 cm 计，美制为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10/H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span>）、垂直起止高度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.003</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>75</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">VM = 1 - 0.003|V - 75|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.003∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">75∣</span></span></span></span></span>、垂直位移距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.82</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">DM = 0.82 + 4.5/D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.82</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.5/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>、躯干不对称角度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.0032</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AM = 1 - 0.0032A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.0032</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>，以及由频率表查得的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">FM</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 与由握持条件表查得的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CM</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>（<a href=\"https://www.cdc.gov/niosh/docs/94-110/default.html\">NIOSH 修订版提升方程</a>）。提升指数定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>实际重量</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>W</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LI = \\text{实际重量} / RWL</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">实际重量</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LI &gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 表示该任务已超出方程给出的推荐限值。</p>\n<p>这个方程的价值在于它把「安全重量」还原成一组可观测量。使用它做系统设计时，不必让每个订单去算精确的 RWL，而是取几组<strong>典型工位姿态</strong>算出各自的 RWL，作为分档阈值：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>载荷中心 H</th>\n<th>起始高度 V</th>\n<th>不对称角 A</th>\n<th>典型 RWL</th>\n<th>判读</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>从地面直抬、正对</td>\n<td>30 cm</td>\n<td>0 cm</td>\n<td>0°</td>\n<td>≈ 16 kg</td>\n<td>单人安全上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>从车厢尾板抬到地面</td>\n<td>40 cm</td>\n<td>75 cm</td>\n<td>30°</td>\n<td>≈ 11 kg</td>\n<td>转弯与视线受限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>两人协同（合力系数 0.5）</td>\n<td>25 cm</td>\n<td>40 cm</td>\n<td>0°</td>\n<td>≈ 每人 12 kg</td>\n<td>合计约 24–30 kg</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>楼梯上抬（不对称 + 台阶）</td>\n<td>35 cm</td>\n<td>20–90 cm</td>\n<td>45°</td>\n<td>≈ 8 kg</td>\n<td>单人显著下降</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>表中的具体数值随参数变化，工程上应把它算成一张查询表而不是硬编码。更新的做法是：<strong>每次派送前，用商品档案里的单件重量 + 目标楼层/楼梯条件，查出这一单属于哪一档</strong>，并把结论写进派送单。</p>\n<h3 id=\"两人协同的折减\">两人协同的折减</h3><p>两人合力不是简单相加。受限于配合精度、受力不均与空间限制，行业实践中两人合力通常取单人限值的 1.5–2 倍而不是 2 倍。系统里应当显式保留一个 <code>team_lift_factor</code>（典型取 1.6–1.8），而不是写死乘以 2：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"function liftCapacityKg(singleLimitKg, mode, teamFactor = 1.7, deviceLimitKg = null):&#10;    if mode == &quot;solo&quot;:&#10;        return singleLimitKg&#10;    if mode == &quot;two_person&quot;:&#10;        return round(singleLimitKg * teamFactor, 1)&#10;    if mode == &quot;assisted&quot;:        # 爬楼机 / 吊具&#10;        return deviceLimitKg ?? singleLimitKg&#10;    error &quot;unknown mode: &quot; + mode&#10;&#10;function decideMode(pkg, access):&#10;    if pkg.maxDimensionM &gt; 1.8 or pkg.weightKg &gt; liftCapacityKg(SOLO, &quot;solo&quot;):&#10;        if access.stairClimberAvailable and pkg.weightKg &lt;= CLIMBER_LIMIT:&#10;            return &quot;assisted&quot;&#10;        if pkg.weightKg &lt;= liftCapacityKg(SOLO, &quot;two_person&quot;):&#10;            return &quot;two_person&quot;&#10;        return &quot;mechanical_hoist&quot;&#10;    return &quot;solo&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function liftCapacityKg(singleLimitKg, mode, teamFactor = 1.7, deviceLimitKg = null):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if mode == \"solo\":</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return singleLimitKg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if mode == \"two_person\":</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return round(singleLimitKg * teamFactor, 1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if mode == \"assisted\":        # 爬楼机 / 吊具</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return deviceLimitKg ?? singleLimitKg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    error \"unknown mode: \" + mode</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function decideMode(pkg, access):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if pkg.maxDimensionM > 1.8 or pkg.weightKg > liftCapacityKg(SOLO, \"solo\"):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if access.stairClimberAvailable and pkg.weightKg &#x3C;= CLIMBER_LIMIT:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            return \"assisted\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if pkg.weightKg &#x3C;= liftCapacityKg(SOLO, \"two_person\"):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            return \"two_person\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return \"mechanical_hoist\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return \"solo\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段逻辑的意义是让「需要几人」成为一个可测试的纯函数，而不是散落在调度规则里的 if-else。有了它，当安全团队调整限值时，只需改一个参数，全量历史订单可以重算影响面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"单人限值之外的现实约束\">单人限值之外的现实约束</h2><h3 id=\"体积与握持\">体积与握持</h3><p>重量达标不等于能搬。一张 2 米长的板件只有 25 公斤，但单人无法搬运，因为找不到两个可靠握持点，且长件转动时会扫到墙面与门框。因此判定不能只看重量，必须并置一个<strong>尺寸可达性</strong>维度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>可单人搬运</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>w</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext> 握持点充足</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{可单人搬运} \\iff w \\le L_{solo} \\ \\wedge \\ \\max(d_i) \\le D_{solo} \\ \\wedge \\ \\text{握持点充足}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7073em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">可单人搬运</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">so</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">so</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">握持点充足</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>典型的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{solo}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">so</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在 1.6–1.8 米量级。超过这个长度即使很轻也属于两人件，因为需要一前一后抬，而这种抬法在楼梯转角处需要额外的转向空间——这就接到了第 2.2 篇（<a href=\"../two-man-delivery-scheduling/appointment-slot-stair-elevator\">预约时段与楼梯/电梯/入户限制</a>）的转角宽度判定。</p>\n<h3 id=\"包装与现场保护\">包装与现场保护</h3><p>两人抬升的现场是客户的居住空间，墙面、地板、门框都可能是损坏对象。因此两人班组的车辆装备清单不是可选项：护角与护墙板防磕碰、搬运带把手让握持点可靠（也提高了前面提到的「握持点充足」条件）、地面垫布防刮伤、以及拆下的包装物收纳袋。这些装备的缺失会直接转化为第 4.2 篇（<a href=\"../haulaway-damage-exception/delivery-damage-install-fail\">破损与安装失败处置</a>）里的室内损坏索赔，而室内损坏的赔付争议通常比商品破损更难处理，因为举证困难。</p>\n<h2 id=\"班组编制与派单约束\">班组编制与派单约束</h2><h3 id=\"班组是一个不可拆分单元\">班组是一个不可拆分单元</h3><p>双人班组的排班与派单必须把它们当作<strong>一个资源</strong>而不是两个。把两位成员分别排进两个订单会导致两单都只有一人，这在小件派送里是效率优化，在大件里是安全事故。因此调度模型里应有一个 <code>crew</code>（班组）实体，成员是它的属性而非独立资源：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE crew (&#10;  crew_id        TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  vehicle_id     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  depot_id       TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  shift_start    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  shift_end      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  max_lift_mode  TEXT NOT NULL,        -- solo / two_person / assisted&#10;  has_stair_climber BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,&#10;  equipment      JSONB NOT NULL&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE crew_member (&#10;  crew_id        TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES crew(crew_id),&#10;  worker_id      TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  role           TEXT NOT NULL,        -- driver / assistant&#10;  license_class  TEXT,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (crew_id, worker_id)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> crew</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  crew_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  vehicle_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  depot_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  shift_start    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  shift_end      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  max_lift_mode  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- solo / two_person / assisted</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  has_stair_climber </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FALSE,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  equipment      JSONB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> crew_member</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  crew_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> crew(crew_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  worker_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  role</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- driver / assistant</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  license_class  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (crew_id, worker_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>max_lift_mode</code> 与 <code>has_stair_climber</code> 是派单的硬过滤器：一个订单判定为 <code>assisted</code>，就只能派给带爬楼机或吊具的班组。这个过滤必须发生在候选集生成阶段，而不是在人工调度时靠提醒——因为不符合条件的班组一旦被派出，现场是没有兜底方案的。</p>\n<h3 id=\"工时与作业时长的联动\">工时与作业时长的联动</h3><p>双人班组的可用作业时间受驾驶与工时规则约束。在北美跨境大件场景里，承运司机的驾驶时段受 FMCSA 的工时规则约束：<a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/cfr/text/49/395.3\">49 CFR § 395.3</a> 规定财产运输司机在连续 10 小时休息后方可驾驶，14 小时值班窗口内累计驾驶不得超过 11 小时，且驾驶超过 8 小时须有至少连续 30 分钟的中断；7 天 60 小时或 8 天 70 小时是值班总量上限。这些数字进入调度系统的含义是：<strong>大件派送单的时长估算不能只顾装卸，还要把区间行驶纳入当日的 14 小时窗口</strong>。一辆双人车在一天里能完成的订单数因此有一个由工时规则决定的硬上限，时段容量规划必须承认它（见第 2.2 篇的时段库存部分）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>两人派送是由提升限值推导出的编制，判定的核心是一个可计算的分档：单人限值 / 两人协同限值 / 必须机械吊装。</li>\n<li>NIOSH 修订版提升方程给出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>W</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>H</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>V</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RWL = LC \\times HM \\times VM \\times DM \\times AM \\times FM \\times CM</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>23</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LC = 23</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">23</span></span></span></span></span> kg、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>重量</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>W</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LI = 重量/RWL</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">重量</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>；工程上应把典型工位姿态算成查询表而非逐单精算。</li>\n<li>两人合力应取单人限值的 1.6–1.8 倍并作为显式参数，而不是写死乘 2。</li>\n<li>重量达标不等于可搬：长件即使轻也需要两人与转向空间，尺寸可达性与重量并列判定。</li>\n<li>班组是不可拆分资源，<code>max_lift_mode</code> 与装备是派单硬过滤器；大件单的时长估算要纳入 FMCSA 工时窗口（11 小时驾驶 / 14 小时值班 / 30 分钟中断 / 60–70 小时周期），因此每日可完成单数有法定上限。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"两人入户派送（two-man）","id":"两人入户派送-two-man"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"提升限值的量化","id":"提升限值的量化"},{"level":3,"text":"NIOSH 提升方程","id":"niosh-提升方程"},{"level":3,"text":"两人协同的折减","id":"两人协同的折减"},{"level":2,"text":"单人限值之外的现实约束","id":"单人限值之外的现实约束"},{"level":3,"text":"体积与握持","id":"体积与握持"},{"level":3,"text":"包装与现场保护","id":"包装与现场保护"},{"level":2,"text":"班组编制与派单约束","id":"班组编制与派单约束"},{"level":3,"text":"班组是一个不可拆分单元","id":"班组是一个不可拆分单元"},{"level":3,"text":"工时与作业时长的联动","id":"工时与作业时长的联动"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"安装配件包与备件库存","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bulky-goods-whiteglove-delivery/bulky-inbound-local-warehouse/installation-kit-parts-stock"},"next":{"title":"预约时段与楼梯/电梯/入户限制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/bulky-goods-whiteglove-delivery/two-man-delivery-scheduling/appointment-slot-stair-elevator"}}